{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rune Dice",
    "steam_appid": 3542380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Dice</strong> combines the strategic depth of deckbuilding games with the exciting mechanics of dice throwing. Battle hordes of enemies using the magic of ancient runes!</p> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Deck of Runes</h2> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use ancient runes, each with unique power. From the defensive Shield Rune that blocks enemy attacks to the Frost Rune that immobilizes opponents - create your collection and discover powerful synergies.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/734a48dad4d221043be77d79d0cca528.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=167 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/734a48dad4d221043be77d79d0cca528.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the more interesting it gets. Perform rune evolution rituals that dramatically change their abilities. Transform your Poison Rune to spread toxins upon enemy death, or enhance your Shield Rune to reflect damage to attackers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and throw your dice. Each throw is an opportunity to create powerful combinations and activate your runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/53b62342345ab4470f7b62727a130235.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/53b62342345ab4470f7b62727a130235.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target identical dice to merge them into a new, stronger one. Or throw at different dice to knock them around like in a pool game. Every turn, you'll need to find the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/1ed6e00ca74cc743311fe2b129ffcab6.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/1ed6e00ca74cc743311fe2b129ffcab6.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your strategy based on the active rune on the table and the upcoming rune line. Sometimes it's better to go for maximum points, while other times it's smarter to set up the dice for a powerful combination in your next moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and improve your collection of runes during adventure. Find new runes in shops, get them by merging special dice, or discover them during special events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/c57f35e62a3199a5cc557d0c6f191f7b.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/c57f35e62a3199a5cc557d0c6f191f7b.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations. For example, use a Poison Rune with a Freeze Rune to immobilize enemies while the poison devours them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Turn-based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies require different strategies to win. Armored foes ignore weak hits, but are vulnerable to poison. Archers attack from afar, while melee fighters advance rapidly. Beware of special abilities - enemies also throw their dice onto the arena. If you merge them - winning will become much more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/eec1cf09b4122aa34ddbe4edab3d7387.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/eec1cf09b4122aa34ddbe4edab3d7387.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mystical Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect unique relics that can radically change your gameplay style. Combine them with your rune deck to create devastating combinations and unlock new strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/b5cef8ee374b55ffdf6e3e62a2fee19e.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique, offering different paths, encounters, and rewards. Learn from each attempt, unlock new content, and discover increasingly powerful synergies as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/0f8b511999903bacd074aac676db9d41.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/0f8b511999903bacd074aac676db9d41.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection of runes, master the art of dice throwing, and find awesome synergies to make enemies tremble in fear. Can you assemble the perfect deck for victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Dice</strong> combines the strategic depth of deckbuilding games with the exciting mechanics of dice throwing. Battle hordes of enemies using the magic of ancient runes!</p> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Deck of Runes</h2> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use ancient runes, each with unique power. From the defensive Shield Rune that blocks enemy attacks to the Frost Rune that immobilizes opponents - create your collection and discover powerful synergies.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/734a48dad4d221043be77d79d0cca528.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=167 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/734a48dad4d221043be77d79d0cca528.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the more interesting it gets. Perform rune evolution rituals that dramatically change their abilities. Transform your Poison Rune to spread toxins upon enemy death, or enhance your Shield Rune to reflect damage to attackers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and throw your dice. Each throw is an opportunity to create powerful combinations and activate your runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/53b62342345ab4470f7b62727a130235.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/53b62342345ab4470f7b62727a130235.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target identical dice to merge them into a new, stronger one. Or throw at different dice to knock them around like in a pool game. Every turn, you'll need to find the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/1ed6e00ca74cc743311fe2b129ffcab6.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/1ed6e00ca74cc743311fe2b129ffcab6.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your strategy based on the active rune on the table and the upcoming rune line. Sometimes it's better to go for maximum points, while other times it's smarter to set up the dice for a powerful combination in your next moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and improve your collection of runes during adventure. Find new runes in shops, get them by merging special dice, or discover them during special events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/c57f35e62a3199a5cc557d0c6f191f7b.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/c57f35e62a3199a5cc557d0c6f191f7b.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations. For example, use a Poison Rune with a Freeze Rune to immobilize enemies while the poison devours them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Turn-based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies require different strategies to win. Armored foes ignore weak hits, but are vulnerable to poison. Archers attack from afar, while melee fighters advance rapidly. Beware of special abilities - enemies also throw their dice onto the arena. If you merge them - winning will become much more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/eec1cf09b4122aa34ddbe4edab3d7387.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/eec1cf09b4122aa34ddbe4edab3d7387.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mystical Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect unique relics that can radically change your gameplay style. Combine them with your rune deck to create devastating combinations and unlock new strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/b5cef8ee374b55ffdf6e3e62a2fee19e.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique, offering different paths, encounters, and rewards. Learn from each attempt, unlock new content, and discover increasingly powerful synergies as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/0f8b511999903bacd074aac676db9d41.poster.avif?t=1746336177\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542380/extras/0f8b511999903bacd074aac676db9d41.webm?t=1746336177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection of runes, master the art of dice throwing, and find awesome synergies to make enemies tremble in fear. Can you assemble the perfect deck for victory?</p>",
